  "body": "Experience the pinnacle of luxury living in this superb solid masonry home, where a true touch of the Caribbean meets breathtaking Gulf views. This beautiful 473sqm (approximately) luxury residence represents ultimate value, paired with incredible vistas over the Hauraki Gulf and out to Rangitoto Island. From the moment you arrive, the commanding street frontage portrays a superior home built to a meticulous standard that exudes sophistication.\r\n\r\nSituated so closely to the sea, this is a true sanctuary that will appeal tremendously to boating and nautical enthusiasts. The coveted north-facing position encompasses sweeping sea views, taking in the glittering city lights and the lush green spaces. Immaculate presentation will satisfy the discerning buyer with an unwavering eye for detail.\r\n\r\nA grand entrance creates a welcoming foyer, leading to a perfectly positioned designer kitchen featuring sleek granite benchtops and seamless access to a sunny patio. The expansive, welcoming alfresco decks flow effortlessly from the living areas, providing the gold standard in outdoor flow from this incredible manor-style home.\r\n\r\nEngineered for comfort, this 'Casa' features double-glazing throughout majority of the home, comprehensive underfloor heating and several heat pumps, in addition to six cosy gas fireplaces. There is superb flexibility in the configuration of the multiple living areas, including a spacious rumpus room, a modern office, and a dedicated home-theatre room. There are four beautifully decorated bedrooms, each featuring French doors to frame the maximum views. The master suite is of grand proportions, creating a private retreat for the owners with an abundance of wardrobe space and a sumptuous ensuite complete with its own gas fireplace.\r\n\r\nExquisite décor over three levels combined with exceptional fittings and fixtures makes this property the definition of sheer indulgence. Standout features include a bespoke, temperature-controlled wine cellar (1,500-bottle capacity), a salt-water jet swimming pool, a large Hot Springs Spa, and four-car internal garaging.\r\n\r\nThis is a rare opportunity to secure a trophy home of this calibre. \r\n\r\n** Viewings are available by appointment - call today to arrange your private tour. **",
